{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>據新華社5月6日報道，中國外長王毅在北京與伊朗外長阿拉格齊（Abbas Araghchi）舉行會談。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250716/1022151792147828736549301.jpeg/9O54myfBFcqVkJ2g6d03vQ_aWy31A3cEth7AarYewGo\" alt=\"中國外交部長王毅7月16日在天津會見伊朗外長阿拉格齊（Abbas Araqchi）（中國外交部）\"><figcaption>中國外交部長王毅7月16日在天津會見伊朗外長阿拉格齊（Abbas Araqchi）（中國外交部）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-06T02:44:24.786612+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":1,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none"}}